.TH CALENDER 1.SH NAMEcalender \- a year's calendar, in German.SH SYNOPSIS\fBcalender\fR.SH DESCRIPTION\fBcalender\fRasks\fBFuer welches Jahr?\fR-- for which year -- and prints that year's calendar, three monthsacross, the days of the week down the side in German:\fBMontag\fR to \fBSonntag\fR.\fRIt asks again after each; RETURN on its own ends it..SH NOTESNeeds Microware's\fBcio\fR.\fR.SH SEE ALSOcal, calen